  "body": "## What's Changed\n\n- fix(test): make podcast permissions check portable by Bjarne Oeverli ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`af4d03f`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/af4d03fb0c0f43ee0bcd66551773d83217fce01e))\n- fix(ui): use Ctrl+I to toggle metadata by Bjarne Oeverli ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`e3e6fd4`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/e3e6fd4a4f521d2182cdea81f450fe66dc44ccc9))\n- feat: add podcasts and metadata settings by Bjarne Oeverli ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`9ea5366`](https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/commit/9ea5366c18a8d613f25678756586b17f0f746060))\n\n\n## Checksums (SHA256)\n\n```\n67662a8ea57aaf22030c4d096805a26700787c017085e8ec4844e7b77e8da75c  cliamp-darwin-amd64\n52210e7a8aeac519154b9c556851684a3be63e54d88ae78c61c9f5ec690849f3  cliamp-darwin-arm64\n60fd335e367d920fbfa898a6c87e419616acb55e712e17b5439ab7573f60d882  cliamp-linux-amd64\n94ae39f5ade4b762293c479c120242925b70187cb09101c9c9ea911f4811a8b4  cliamp-linux-arm64\nc018c8c553361bf944b6cc5c42536a81d8bf2a0532d61adc40a9015ff3850a1f  cliamp-windows-amd64.exe\naf52351e5c76562af2c44d973222aa059527cf866406bf34ab66cc98c27f5c40  cliamp-windows-amd64.zip\n```\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/bjarneo/cliamp/compare/v2.1.0...v2.2.0\n",
